500/30 h-12 w-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><h1 class=\"mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-white\">Üdv újra az <span class=\"text-brand-500\">AutoFit AI</span>-nál</h1><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">A fiókoddal elmented az autóidat, nyomon követheted a kompatibilitási ellenőrzéseidet és kedvencnek jelölheted a fontos alkatrészeket.</p><ul class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-graphite-300\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span>Autógarázs: mentsd és kezeld a járműveidet</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-graphite-300\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span>Mentett kompatibilitási ellenőrzések és eredmények</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-graphite-300\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span>Kedvenc alkatrészek egy helyen</li></ul><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.07] px-4 py-3\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-300\">i</span><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-emerald-100/90 sm:text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-200\">Valós adatbázis.</strong> Az alkatrész-, jármű- és kompatibilitási adatok a csatlakoztatott Supabase (PostgreSQL) adatbázisból származnak. A kompatibilitást kizárólag a <span class=\"font-mono\">fitments</span> tábla rekordjai döntik el – a rendszer nem talál ki adatot.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card p-6 shadow-card sm:p-8\"><div class=\"mb-6 lg:hidden\"><span class=\"relative grid shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 h-11 w-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span></div><h2 class=\"font-display text-xl font-extrabold text-white\">Bejelentkezés</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-graphite-400\">Add meg az e-mail címed és a jelszavad.</p><form class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\"><div><label class=\"label\" for=\"email\">E-mail cím</label><div class=\"relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-graphite-500\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" class=\"input pl-10\" placeholder=\"pelda@email.hu\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div><label class=\"label\" for=\"password\">Jelszó</label><div class=\"relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-graphite-500\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><input id=\"password\" type=\"password\" class=\"input pl-10\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autoComplete=\"current-password\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"mt-2 text-right\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300\" href=\"/jelszo-visszaallitas\">Elfelejtetted a jelszavad?</a></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary w-full py-3\">Bejelentkezés<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></form><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-ink-700 pt-5 text-center text-sm text-graphite-400\">Még nincs fiókod?<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-center text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-500\">Admin fiókkal a<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300\" href=\"/admin\">/admin</a> <!-- -->felületen is be tudsz jelentkezni.</p></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-20 border-t border-ink-800 bg-ink-950\"><div class=\"container-page py-14\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-none\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">AutoFit<span class=\"text-brand-500\"> AI</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-graphite-500\">Parts Compatibility</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Modern autóalkatrész-kompatibilitási platform. Találd meg a járművedhez illő alkatrészt – gyorsan, átláthatóan, megbízhatóan.</p><div class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-500/25 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-300\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-400\"></span>Valós adatbázis · Supabase</div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Kompatibilitás ellenőrző</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Alkatrészkereső</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/garazs\">Autógarázs</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/utitervek\">Fejlesztési útiterv</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Fiók</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/bejelentkezes\">Bejelentkezés</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/fiok\">Felhasználói fiók</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400